<title>RUSSIA: Deutsche plans to open full Russia bank this year.</title>
<headline>Deutsche plans to open full Russia bank this year.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A board member of Deutsche Bank AG said on Friday that the bank planned to open a full Russian subsidiary in Moscow later this year.</p>
<p>&quot;This year we will convert our representative office into a full bank,&quot; Georg Krupp told a Moscow news conference. He said the bank expected to start a full range of banking activities in the second half of next year.</p>
<p>Deutsche Bank's investment banking subsidiary Deutsche Morgan Grenfell already operates in Moscow will a full investment banking licence.</p>
</text>
